{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":497095,"name":"Jason","username":"stacker21","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/3d9bf3/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T15:29:21.739Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser should be able to share only the vault of choosing, not the entire 1Password account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnect 1Password in GrokBot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser should be able to share only the vault of choosing, not the entire 1Password account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/4/0/40a1b45a3cb727aca6ac79843a2c803140812245.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/9dL0wjrRL5GSKmXIvTBUmynepvv.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"image.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discours